样沉心思索、善用谋略，方能寻得破局之路。NOR"}},{type="doc",args={"YEL灵猴：来，先喝杯茶。NOR"}},{type="doc",args={"CYN灵猴规整桌面，缓缓摆好茶具。NOR"}},{type="showbutton",args={1,0}},{type="showbutton",args={2,1}}},caozuoName2="交谈",buttonShow2=0,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"YEL灵猴：我这里有三种茶，不知道你想泡哪壶呢。NOR"}},{type="change",args={"znqd5npc09","znqd5npc10"}}},buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={}},result3={},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,condition6={relation="and",conditions={}},result6={},autoCondition1={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult1={},autoCondition2={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult2={},autoCondition3={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult3={},autoCondition4={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult4={},autoCondition5={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult5={},autoCondition6={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult6={},autoCondition7={relation="and",conditions={}},autoResult7={}},znqd5npc10={id="znqd5npc10",baseId="rwnpc2601",combatid={1,1001},name="灵猴",teamMark=-1,canSee=1,caozuoName1="雨前龙井",buttonShow1=1,condition1={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result1={{type="doc",args={"YEL灵猴：好茶，看来少侠是个温和恬淡的人，如同雨前龙井一般清润绵长，便与你讲讲武林旧事。NOR"}},{type="change",args={"znqd5npc10","znqd5npc11"}}},caozuoName2="武夷岩茶",buttonShow2=1,condition2={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result2={{type="doc",args={"YEL灵猴：好茶，看来少侠是个刚正果敢的人，如同武夷岩茶一般浓烈醇厚，便与你讲讲武林旧事。NOR"}},{type="change",args={"znqd5npc10","znqd5npc11"}}},caozuoName3="陈年普洱",buttonShow3=1,condition3={relation="and",conditions={{type="kick",args={}}}},result3={{type="doc",args={"YEL灵猴：好茶，看来少侠是个通透豁达的人，如同陈年普洱一般温润沉敛，便与你讲讲武林旧事。NOR"}},{type="change",args={"znqd5npc10","znqd5npc11"}}},buttonShow4=1,condition4={relation="and",conditions={}},result4={},buttonShow5=1,condition5={relation="and",conditions={}},result5={},buttonShow6=1,conditi